 645:           opening starts from `sealed` too, but with the roll already in hand
 646:           (openSealed in state.ts), and that box is about to open rather than
 647:           waiting on anything - so the line follows the roll, not the phase.
 648:         */}
 649:         {phase === 'sealed' && !roll && <p className="cash-gacha-status">{t('cashShop.sealedWait')}</p>}
 650:         {phase === 'settled' && order && <p className="cash-gacha-status">{orderStatus(order)}</p>}
 651:       </div>
