1226: // Motion is removed by not rendering it, never by zeroing a duration: a
1227: // `forwards` animation collapsed to 0.01ms lands on its END state, which for
1228: // the shatter is a vanished box and for the slam a darkened stage. Opacity
1229: // is not vestibular, so a soft cross-fade stays. The clock in state.ts skips
1230: // the moving beats on its own; this sheet only has to agree with it.
1231: @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
1232:   .cash-shop .cash-gacha,
1233:   .cash-shop .cash-gacha *,
1234:   .cash-shop .cash-fee,
1235:   .cash-shop .cash-frame-flash,
