1254:     display: none !important;
1255:   }
1256: 
1257:   // Drawn at rest, in the position they hold at settle, so nothing jumps.
1258:   // The clasp needs nothing here: SEAL_CALM goes straight from `shut` to
1259:   // `sealed` with no beat of its own for the snap, and removing the animation
1260:   // outright - rather than zeroing it - leaves the lock simply there, which
1261:   // is where it belongs. It still comes off at the seam, from the phase rules
