 21: /**
 22:  * The learned-skill list: every skill the server taught (`Store.skills`),
 23:  * with its icon, name, level, mana / AG cost and the master level of a
 24:  * master skill, greyed when `skills.requirementsMet` fails (the hotbar's
 25:  * `bCantSkill` rule). A click makes it the current skill, like a click on a
 26:  * hotbar slot. The original has no such window - its list *is* the five
 27:  * scrolling bar slots - so this uses the item-window chrome. Toggled by the
 28:  * skill-list key (K); the master button below opens the master tree.
 29:  */
 30: 
 31: const WINDOW_ID = 'skill-list';
 32: const HOT_KEY = 'skillList';
 33: 
